WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.876
Read a tarot spread in a set order, one step at a
time, and even a large layout stays manageable.

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:11.141
Step one: start with the question.

00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:14.609
Before you turn a card, decide what you
want to think about.

00:00:15.909 --> 00:00:17.636
Step two: check the positions.

00:00:17.636 --> 00:00:20.573
Look at the layout before you look at the
pictures.

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:21.955
Each position has a job.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:25.986
In a three-card spread, the positions
might be past, present and next.

00:00:27.386 --> 00:00:29.706
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:29.706 --> 00:00:34.410
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
